1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,569
You hit post,

2
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:02,759
and every social
app disappears.

3
00:00:03,029 --> 00:00:04,699
Your coffee
keeps sliding.

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,680
Five seconds
without feeds

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,280
or social
messages.

6
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:10,670
Your camera and
SMS still work.

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,620
You tap the empty
space again.

8
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,820
Across the
table,

9
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,530
your friend
points down.

10
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,820
Your cup reaches
the edge.

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,460
Your next move
needs hands,

12
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,550
not followers.

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,740
You catch it.

14
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,800
No spill.

15
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,880
Your friend
watched that

16
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,610
whole ridiculous
rescue.

17
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,380
Your friend
laughs.

18
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,240
You laugh back,

19
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,410
with no camera
between you.

20
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,960
At second five,

21
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,860
social media
returns.

22
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,020
Your unfinished
post

23
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,350
is still
waiting.

24
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,040
Your phone goes
face down.

25
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,470
The coffee
survived.

26
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,930
This moment stays
off camera.
